==Battleground==
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 9 seconds<sup>270f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[B.B.Bunny]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**10 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Make sure you have an abundance of [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red Cats]] in your loadout and a good amount of meatshields. Money should not be an issue as all of the enemies here drop large sums of cash.

